# Three pairs inside the core_pot range, one per block.
#
# core_pot is defined on r in [0.05, 1.0] A and is identically zero beyond it,
# so every equilibrated structure gives it exactly zero -- which is why the
# glassy-carbon cell cannot check it. Here C-C, C-O and O-O sit at 0.75, 0.65
# and 0.85 A, and the pairs are ~7 A apart so they do not see each other.

